2
00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:43.390
<b>Thank You For Loving Me</b>

3
00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:54.600
Ace...

4
00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:23.860
Ace!

5
00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:28.220
Ace-san!

6
00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.660
Ace!

7
00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:53.610
He's been beaten! Dammit!

8
00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:00.090
Stop Akainu!

9
00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.030
Fire!

10
00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:29.980
How will this war end?

11
00:04:56.610 --> 00:05:00.280
No way! Is he a monster?!

12
00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:27.170
So you're still alive, then?

13
00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:33.970
Stop...

14
00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.180
Stop!

15
00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.580
Jinbe!

16
00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:44.960
You can't touch him anymore!

17
00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:48.710
You're just delaying the inevitable, Jinbe!

18
00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:51.260
Since you used to be a Warlord...

19
00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:54.120
you should know exactly how strong I am.

20
00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:59.520
If I can buy us some time by risking my life, then I'll gladly do so!

21
00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:03.840
I've been prepared to die from the very beginning!

22
00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:06.610
Jinbe!

23
00:06:06.610 --> 00:06:09.110
Marco! That guy's here!

24
00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:13.910
Gee, thank you for helping me! I almost died...

25
00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:16.120
Just shut up and unlock this thing!

26
00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.480
V-Vice Admiral Garp!

27
00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.930
What are you...?

28
00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:31.900
Garp!

29
00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:40.560
What are you doing?! Have you lost your mind?!

30
00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:45.220
You better keep holding me down, Sengoku!

31
00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:53.320
Because if you don't, I will kill Sakazuki!

32
00:06:54.960 --> 00:06:56.630
You fool!

33
00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:05.440
I guess I need to execute a traitor, too.

34
00:07:10.550 --> 00:07:12.180
Jinbe, get down!

35
00:07:20.850 --> 00:07:23.710
How annoying!

36
00:07:25.850 --> 00:07:27.760
So you guys are Haki users!

37
00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.600
How could we let that happen?!

38
00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:33.430
I'll never forgive myself for this!

39
00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:37.620
Can't you see that Fire Fist can't be saved?

40
00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.320
Take a look!

41
00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.090
Ace...

42
00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:04.040
Hey, are you all right? Hey.

43
00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:16.810
Ace, you need to get treated right away!

44
00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.980
I'm sorry, Luffy...

45
00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:22.510
Huh?

46
00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.990
To save me...

47
00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:32.780
you pushed yourself so hard...

48
00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:36.740
but I won't be able to make it out of here...

49
00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:41.330
I'm sorry.

50
00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.710
Wh-What are you saying?

51
00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.610
Don't be ridiculous!

52
00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.970
Somebody, treat him!

53
00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.740
Please! Please help Ace!

54
00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:57.090
Hey, somebody! Help Ace! Please!

55
00:08:57.090 --> 00:09:00.100
Hurry! This way! Give him first aid now!

56
00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:00.950
Okay!

57
00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.660
Straw Hat-boy...

58
00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.260
Ace! Are you all right?!

59
00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.610
Hurry up and treat him!

60
00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:11.840
Okay, let me see the wound!

61
00:09:11.840 --> 00:09:12.830
Please!

62
00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:17.660
This is...!

63
00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:20.900
Huh?

64
00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:22.750
Hey.

65
00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:26.510
What's the matter? Hurry up and help him!

66
00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:30.170
I'm sorry.

67
00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:35.210
What do you mean by that?

68
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.820
What's going on?! Just do something!

69
00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:42.930
Hey, aren't you a doctor?! Hey!

70
00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:45.410
It's no use.

71
00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.950
My organs have been burned.

72
00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:52.340
I'm not gonna last long.

73
00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.200
I can tell...

74
00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:58.510
that my life is ending...

75
00:09:58.510 --> 00:09:59.980
Ace...

76
00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:03.130
what are you saying?

77
00:10:03.130 --> 00:10:06.320
Are you gonna die?!

78
00:10:06.320 --> 00:10:09.400
You promised me...

79
00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:12.860
that you'd never die...

80
00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:18.130
no matter what, Ace!

81
00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:25.000
I would've given up a long time ago...

82
00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:33.280
if it weren't for Sabo and a
high-maintenance brother like you.

83
00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:39.750
If Gold Roger had a kid?

84
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.960
Of course I know what'd happen to him!

85
00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.860
They'd get their head cut off for sure!

86
00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:52.650
No way! I wouldn't be happy if the kid died that easily.

87
00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:58.340
How about shoving needles into that kid until the number equals the people that hated Roger!

88
00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:04.170
No way! We should burn him at the stake...

89
00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:10.330
and humiliate him in front of the whole world!

90
00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:11.750
That sounds nice!

91
00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:16.030
They'll all say: "It serves you right!"

92
00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:21.480
I'd want his last words to be...

93
00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:25.930
"I'm sorry I was born. I'm nothing but trash."

94
00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:32.440
Ah, well... I doubt that brat actually exists.

95
00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:42.380
No one wanted me to exist.

96
00:11:49.110 --> 00:11:52.820
Ace! Did you start trouble in town again?

97
00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:56.590
Everybody is talking about it!
 Why can't you stay out of trouble for our sake?

98
00:11:56.590 --> 00:11:58.150
Shut up, Dadan!

99
00:11:58.150 --> 00:11:59.570
What?!

100
00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:04.830
If I was stronger, I would've killed them all.

101
00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:17.180
Oh yeah. If you ever see Dadan again... can you give her my regards?

102
00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:24.460
Facing my own death, I even miss a woman like her.

103
00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:30.030
Like I said, don't say that you're gonna die!

104
00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:34.430
There is one thing... that makes me want to stay...

105
00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:40.560
That's my desire to see you fulfill your dream.

106
00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:48.430
But... I know you can do it!

107
00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.760
Because you're my little brother!

108
00:12:58.190 --> 00:13:02.410
Just like how I swore on that day...

109
00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:05.200
I have no regrets...

110
00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:09.730
in my life.

111
00:13:09.730 --> 00:13:12.940
Liar! You're lying!

112
00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.890
I'm not lying.

113
00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:24.520
I've realized that what I really wanted... wasn't fame.

114
00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:29.500
Did I deserve to be born?

115
00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:33.470
I wanted to know the answer to that question.

116
00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:38.200
Become my son!

117
00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:44.240
I take it my beloved son is still doing well?

118
00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.240
I'm your brother!

119
00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:49.880
Say whatever the hell you want!

120
00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:53.210
I'm saving you, even if I die!

121
00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:55.360
Men!

122
00:13:55.360 --> 00:14:02.850
Rescue Ace, and destroy the Navy!

123
00:14:17.530 --> 00:14:22.540
I'm not able to shout loudly enough for everyone to hear me anymore...

124
00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:29.490
Could you tell them...

125
00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:32.380
the words I'm about to say?

126
00:14:38.220 --> 00:14:40.630
Pops...

127
00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:44.100
Everybody...

128
00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:47.520
And you, Luffy.

129
00:14:49.290 --> 00:14:56.090
I've always been such a hopeless person...

130
00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:02.910
I was demon spawn... the son of the devil...

131
00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:14.990
Thank you...

132
00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:23.820
for loving me!

133
00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.710
Gramps.

134
00:16:04.330 --> 00:16:06.130
Was it...

135
00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:10.050
good that I was born?

136
00:16:14.590 --> 00:16:17.020
Well, you...

137
00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:22.480
As long as you're alive, you'll figure it out eventually.

138
00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:41.860
Ace...

139
00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:27.920
Did you think I was dead?

140
00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:35.470
But...!

141
00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:39.440
What are you crying about?! I'm alive, you idiot!

142
00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:50.710
I promise you... I will never die!

143
00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:56.090
How could I leave a wimpy
little brother like you behind?

144
00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.450
Garp.

145
00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.990
Take care of my child.

146
00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:05.400
Our child's name is Gol D. Ace.

147
00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:22.650
Didn't ya know? When you exchange sake cups, you become brothers.

148
00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:27.150
From today onward...

149
00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.910
we are brothers!

